The refactoring plan"
  Phase B:
  - AST-only checks (acts, checkpoints, happy, subscript_assignments, no_mutable_defaults) — need IR-data plumbing first.
  - function_contracts — the forbidden-expression dispatcher; its own sub-phase.
  - B-final — drop Module 4's AST-resolution role + reorder so the IR is built before semantic analysis. The deepest change.

  Phase C — Split the front-end package ⬜ not started

  Phase D — Honest core (WhyML-typecheck gate + structured diagnostics + capability manifest) ⬜ not started

  Phase E — Conformance corpora + freeze the front-end contract ⬜ not started

